.TH stool-dotfile-apply 1  "stool-dotfile-apply "
.SH NAME
stool\-dotfile\-apply \- Deploy the local source repository
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstool\-dotfile\-apply\fR [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-\-prompt\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Deploy the local source repository
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Back up and overwrite conflicting destination entries
.TP
\fB\-\-prompt\fR \fI<PROMPT>\fR [default: auto]
Interactive conflict handling (auto only prompts on a terminal)
.br

.br
[\fIpossible values: \fRauto, always, never]
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
